data machine_unit_identity_note: String = "Machine-level acceptance (local controlled repro, RUSTC_WRAPPER unset, CARGO_INCREMENTAL=0, CI-shaped release bin set + cargo test -p v1-compiler-tests --release --no-run). The shared release lib unit identity across build and gate is ONE artifact: cargo fingerprint dir v1-compiler-591811ee6f9846da / lib-v1_compiler.json with profile=2040997289075261528, config=2069994364910194474, compile_kind=0, features=[default, interp_test_witness, test_hooks, text_lookup_work_counter]. BEFORE fix (broken package-relative .git rerun-if-changed restored): after build the lib unit is 591811ee6f9846da; the second cargo invocation logs fingerprint dirty for v1-compiler lib with StaleDepFingerprint\{build_script_build\} and StaleItem(MissingFile\{src/v1/stage0/.git/HEAD\}) — rustc re-executes on the SAME unit identity. AFTER fix (#7910): after build lib unit 591811ee6f9846da; second invocation produces no dirty line for v1-compiler lib and reuses target/release/deps/libv1_compiler-591811ee6f9846da.rlib (gate Finished in 23s warm). Log line count is weaker evidence; the fingerprint identity + dirty-or-fresh disposition is the acceptance bar."

