data fleet_build_job_log_evidence_note: String = "Fleet build job run 31077456733 job 92538509081 (srv1-04, head 5a0414cf32). TWO cargo invocations in one job: (1) release build prints Compiling v1-compiler then Finished release in 21.13s; (2) compile-contract gate prints Compiling v1-compiler-tests then Finished release in 17.61s with NO Compiling v1-compiler line — the dependent invocation reused the first invocation's v1-compiler unit (cargo omits Compiling for a fresh unit). Quoted: 2026-08-06T06:36:48.5552454Z Compiling v1-compiler v0.1.0 (.../src/v1/stage0); 2026-08-06T06:37:08.6981353Z Finished release in 21.13s; 2026-08-06T06:37:08.8943777Z Compiling v1-compiler-tests v0.1.0 (.../src/v1/tests); 2026-08-06T06:37:26.4211587Z Finished release in 17.61s. Counterexample run 31062435170 printed Compiling v1-compiler on the gate step. Wall-clock benefit not claimed from this receipt."
